<title>JAPAN: SOCCER-MANCHESTER UNITED BEAT URAWA REDS 2-1.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MANCHESTER UNITED BEAT URAWA REDS 2-1.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>English premier league champions Manchester United beat Japan's Urawa Reds 2-1 (halftime 2-0) in a friendly on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Urawa Reds - Kenji Oshiba 51</p>
<p>Manchester United - Ole Gunnar Solskjaer 13, 39</p>
